        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Otter_Lake%2C_Michigan",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Otter Lake was incorporated as a village in 1883, officially becoming a municipal entity.",
